{"id": "EUVD-2026-102976", "enisaUuid": "095dcf94-f1da-3b31-8326-921dd6b64ed0", "description": "IceCMS through 4.1.5 contains an unauthenticated sql injection vulnerability that allows remote attackers to inject SQL by supplying a crafted num path parameter to /WebResource/findresourcebynum. Attackers can append SQL after the LIMIT clause concatenated via QueryWrapper.last() to extract database contents using union-based or blind techniques.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:42", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T13:32:07", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/icecms-webresource-webarticle-findbynum-limit-sqli", "https://github.com/Thecosy/IceCMS/blob/afd7a9f0d04a714e7c7e735e566c27f54b5d5201/IceCMS-ment/src/main/java/com/ttice/icewkment/controller/frontend/WebResourceController.java#L128-L134", "https://github.com/Thecosy/IceCMS", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/icecms-through-4.1.5-sql-injection-via-webresource-findresourcebynum"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111685", "GHSA-vqwq-cg9h-83m7"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.43, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "7a316b28-91bf-37f6-96c0-06dc3b8c05d7", "product": {"name": "IceCMS", "vendor": {"name": "Thecosy"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22644.1.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "1f0c0fdd-53c2-3198-8fc7-ac54a2ad1c38", "vendor": {"name": "Thecosy"}}], "isExploited": false}